  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing Maternal Deaths in Rural Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is committed to supporting the Sisters&#x2019; nutrition programme and outreach clinics to help fight against preventable deaths from malnutrition for under 5&#x2019;s and pregnant women. However, there is still great need to support the core maternal health services that the Handmaids Catholic Clinic and Maternity Centre provides.
This project is intended to provide HMS with basic medical equipment, supplies, and materials to prevent complications and preventable maternal deaths in rural Sierra Leone. 
 The following are key items, which would support the Sisters&#x2019; work: 
- PPH kits
-IPC Materials &amp; PPE
-Assorted Medical Supplies (Sutures, Gloves, Syringes, etc.)
-Assorted Medical Equipment (Suctioning Machine, Scanning Machine, Electronic Weighing Scale, Blood Pressure Machine, Oxygen Concentrator, etc.) 
-Delivery Packs</narrative>
  </description>
